			<p>I have my own little linux server under my desk</p>
			<p>Picture of my server machine</p>
		</Body>
	</ProjectBox>

	<ProjectBox Title="Drafty">
		<Status>
			Shelved for now
		</Status>
		<Body>
			<p>
				League of Legends In-House Discord Bot
				Worked with colleagues on a Discord bot with a
				PostgreSQL database and web API to help us manage our
				inhouse League of Legends matches
				DocFX-Generated Documentation
			</p>
			<a href="https://tortoiseeattoes.github.io/Drafty/docs/what-is-drafty.html">Drafty</a>
		</Body>
	</ProjectBox>

	<ProjectBox Title="This website">
		<Status>
			Ongoing
		</Status>
		<Body>
			<p>
				This website is all made in blazor and hosted on Azure
				<a href="https://github.com/TortoiseEatToes/PersonalWebsite">Link to the code for this!</a>
			</p>
		</Body>
	</ProjectBox>
</FluentStack>


